<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>Terms of Service — Albany JW Parking</title>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <link href="/vendor/bootstrap/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/fontawesome/css/fontawesome.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/fontawesome/css/all.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/styles.css">
</head>
<body data-authed="false">

    <%- include('partials/header.ejs') %>

    <main class="container py-5" style="max-width: 780px;">
        <div class="legal-card">

        <h1 class="mb-1">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="text-muted small mb-2">Last updated: May 2025</p>
        <p class="text-muted mb-4">
            We'll keep this short and human — this is a tool built by volunteers, for volunteers.
            There's no fine print to worry about, just a few ground rules to keep things running smoothly.
        </p>

        <section class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h5">Who this is for</h2>
            <p>
                This site is just for parking team volunteers serving at the Albany Regional Convention.
                If you've been invited or approved by a parking overseer, welcome! If you're not sure
                whether you should have access, just reach out to your overseer.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h5">Your account</h2>
            <p>
                Please keep your login credentials to yourself and make sure the information on your
                profile is accurate. If something changes — like your phone number or congregation —
                update it in your account so we can reach you.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h5">Scheduling</h2>
            <p>
                Creating a profile doesn't automatically put you on the schedule — overseers handle
                assignments. Once you're scheduled, please do your best to honor those commitments.
                If something comes up and you can't make a shift, just let your overseer know as soon
                as possible so they can make other arrangements.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h5">Messages from us</h2>
            <p>
                If you signed up with a phone number or email, you may hear from us about your
                schedule or account. SMS messages are sent through Twilio — standard carrier rates
                may apply. You can opt out of texts at any time by replying <strong>STOP</strong>
                to any message we send.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h5">Just be good</h2>
            <p>
                We trust everyone here has good intentions — this is a team of friends serving
                together. Just use the site for what it's meant for, don't poke around in areas
                you haven't been given access to, and don't share other volunteers' personal
                information outside the team.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h5">A note on affiliation</h2>
            <p>
                This site was built and is operated independently by parking team volunteers.
                It is not sponsored, created, or controlled by Jehovah's Witnesses or www.JW.org,
                legally known as the Watch Tower Bible and Tract Society of Pennsylvania.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="h5">Questions or changes</h2>
            <p>
                If anything here changes, we'll update the date above. If you have any questions
                or want to have your account removed, just get in touch with your parking overseer.
                Thanks for everything you do — it's genuinely appreciated.
            </p>
        </section>

    </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer.ejs') %>
    <script src="/vendor/bootstrap/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/cookieConsent.js"></script>
</body>
</html>